    <string name="welcome_greeting">As-salamu ʿalaykum</string>
    <string name="welcome_body">Muhib is a quiet companion. Prayer times for where you are, and on your home screen an ayah, a hadith or a sunnah that waits, covered, until the moment you need it.</string>
    <string name="welcome_continue">Continue</string>
    <string name="welcome_widget_title">Keep it close</string>
    <string name="welcome_widget_body">Tap the reminder once to reveal what came for you, and again to read more. It covers itself again after Fajr and after Maghrib. Prayer times can sit beside it, or in a widget of their own.</string>
    <string name="welcome_add">Choose a widget</string>
    <string name="welcome_manual_title">Or add it yourself</string>
    <string name="welcome_manual_steps">1. Touch and hold an empty spot on your home screen.\n2. Tap Widgets.\n3. Find Muhib, then drag a widget onto your home screen.</string>
