    <string name="prayer_credits">Prayer times are calculated on your phone, and Hijri dates follow the Umm al-Qura calendar. Town and city names come from GeoNames (CC BY 4.0) and are stored in the app. Muhib keeps no backups in the cloud, and it goes online only when you tap Update prayer times, to download times from AlAdhan.</string>
